    <briefdescription>
<para>Configuration model — owns the live ValueTree of all END config. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Two-phase init/reload:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>build() seeds the tree with compiled binary defaults (no I/O).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>load(file) overlays one disk lua file on top (does NOT call build).</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Section list (7 names, single SSOT) — used by build, load, loadPath, and the virgin-disk default write.</para>
<para>Callers must call build() before any <ref refid="classconfig_1_1_model_1a88f26a19f5b816bdad76c460d9d18389" kindref="member">load()</ref> to ensure the tree is valid. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
